# Effect-labels fixture corpus (referenced by tests/label_corpus/manifest.json).
# The generic `contracts/` rule above is meant for the CLI's output dir, but it
# also matches the scaffolded corpus sources — both their top-level `contracts/`
# dirs and the vendored `lib/*/contracts/` deps. Un-ignore those so the frozen
# corpus is committable; the regenerated `out/`/`cache/` build dirs stay ignored.
!labels_redesign/agent1/projects/**/contracts/
!labels_redesign/agent1/projects/**/contracts/**
